<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman upgrades Sema.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman upgrades Sema.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Wednesday it had added computer services group Sema Group Plc to its European priority list, upgrading it from a &quot;recommended list&quot; rating.</p>
<p>The stock was up 37-1/2p at 11.50 stg by 1140 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
